{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>Behind him.</b> Behind Lot." "<b>A pillar.</b> In the sense of מצבה, for she was consumed by the sulfur, and it was with salt, for thus it is written: \"sulfur and salt… like the overturning of Sodom\" (Deuteronomy 29:22). This verse also proves that Zoar escaped; likewise the angel said."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:09.420293503Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}